# Game_TTTT — Tactical Tic-Tac-Toe (ID 27)
# Files: src/coordinator/Game_TTTT.h, Game_TTTT.cpp
# HTML: data/game_tttt_setup.html, game_tttt_names.html, game_tttt_run.html

## GAMEPLAY
Physical tic-tac-toe with pucks. Puck 0 = selector (shows whose turn), pucks 1-N = grid.
Normal mode: claim neutral/opponent pucks. Hard mode: toggle any puck.
1-3 players. Win by 3 in a row.

## CONFIG
- numPlayers (1-3), numPucks (4/6/7/10 = different grid sizes)
- hardMode, autoRestart

## BOARD SIZES
- 4 pucks: 1x3 row (1 win line)
- 6 pucks: 5-on-die (2 diagonal lines)
- 7 pucks: 2x3 grid (2 horizontal lines)
- 10 pucks: 3x3 classic TicTacToe (8 win lines)

## STATES
TTTT_SETUP → TTTT_RUNNING → TTTT_FINISHED (auto-restart after 5s if enabled)

## KEY MECHANICS
- grid[9]: -1=neutral, 0-2=player owner
- Selector puck (idx 0): click → nextPlayer()
- Grid puck (idx 1+): mapped to grid[puckIdx-1]
- Normal: claim neutral/opponent, ignore own
- Hard: toggle between neutral/claimed
- 500ms debounce per puck
- checkWin(): varies by board size (1-8 possible win lines)
- Winner: winning 3 pucks get RAINBOW, others dim in winner color
- Player colors: Blue, Red, Green

## COMMANDS
setup, cfg_ply, cfg_pucks, cfg_hard, cfg_auto, show_layout, start, stop, reset, exit

## STATUS JSON
{st, t (elapsed), cp (current player), sc: [p0_count, p1_count, p2_count]}
